WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:51.350
Someone once said...

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:56.120
There are pugs that have 
a flavorful body made of

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:00.760
first-rate dried plums that 
boast a refined sourness...

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:06.730
Sour Pug created by Ohagimama-san 
of Kanagawa Prefecture!

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:05.800
Sour Pug!

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:16.780
There is corn on the cob with kernels 
containing sweet, pulpy chocolate...

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:20.780
Chocorn!

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:24.750
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:29.790
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:36.130
Chowlin Temple was attacked by the now-evil 
Chiyo and her Gourmet Corp cohorts.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:40.700
Even after sustaining Otake's 
attack, Komatsu was unharmed.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.970
This was thanks to a technique 
forbidden in the Human World.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.410
Otake announced that he was now 
living in the Gourmet World.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:52.350
Then Master Chin rushed in and 
challenged Chiyo to a fight,

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:54.280
but it was a tough battle indeed.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:59.020
Just when the situation was 
at its most desperate...

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.590
Toriko-san!

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:09.960
Sorry I'm late, Komatsu.

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.760
Toriko had mastered Honoring the Food

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:16.400
and used that overwhelming 
strength to defeat the Golem.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:24.180
However, Master Chin was 
beaten soundly by Chiyo!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:36.050
"National Treasure Class" One Stroke 100 Million Yen Technique!
Toriko vs Granny Chiyo!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.010
Master!

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:59.340
Be calm, Toriko...

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:06.280
You mustn't... get emotional...

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:08.290
It will disrupt...

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.920
...Honoring the Food...

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:19.260
It's because you let yourself 
be swayed by emotions.

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:22.430
That threw Honoring the Food into disorder.

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:24.930
There's no point to it at all.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:30.240
Small wonder... Granny Chiyo...

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:35.340
When I heard the reason... for why you 
betrayed us and joined Gourmet Corp...

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.510
In that case...

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:50.090
...shut up and die!

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:54.330
And take your Honoring the 
Food to hell as a souvenir.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:56.830
Master!

00:04:57.070 --> 00:05:00.740
Now then, Gourmet Hunter Toriko...

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:05.740
You've inherited Honoring the Food, 
so I think I'll take this chance

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.440
to snuff you out too...

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:33.570
I can't believe this is happening to the 
Lost Forest! Is Chowlin Temple okay?!

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.200
Toriko-san...

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.300
Komatsu-san...

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:39.110
Master Chin!

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:41.740
Please be safe!

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.670
Toriko-san! Komatsu-san!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.210
I'll buy some time here!

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:18.080
Sorry, Assistant Instructor.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:21.210
But I doubt you'd even 
last a second with her.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:25.780
In terms of raw power, I think 
she's in Granny Setsu's class.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.790
Setsuno...

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.790
I'll deal with her one of these days too.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.430
I'll show you...

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:38.660
...my one stroke that's 
worth 100 million yen.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:44.100
My skill with a blade that's said 
to be "national treasure class"...

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:48.070
Depraved handling of a knife

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:50.910
isn't worth even one yen.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:21.100
You sensed it coming and evaded it, huh?

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:25.940
Impressive reaction. But how long 
will you be able to hold out?

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:39.460
Assistant Instructor!

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.890
Get everyone away from there!

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:47.330
Leg...

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.030
Master!

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:45.830
Master Chin!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.800
...Knife!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:00.810
You're slow!

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:07.480
He did it then...

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.090
Cutting Board Shield!

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.190
Whoa!

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:24.170
He cracked my Cutting Board 
Shield with just one blow?!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.740
Leg Knife!

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:32.840
Knife!

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.080
Knife!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:35.110
Knife!

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:36.180
Knife!

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:37.450
Knife!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:39.180
Knife!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:42.980
What incredible speed and number of attacks!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.320
Stripling!

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:51.020
Don't get

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:57.160
cocky!!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:00.430
Your Honoring the Food is 
in disarray, old woman!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.600
Twin Spiked Punch!

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:04.160
Something that's lost its value...

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.730
...breaks easily.

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.170
Toriko-san!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:12.640
Old woman...

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:16.270
Is this as good as your 
skill with a knife gets?

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:20.540
I didn't want to get it dirty...

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:25.880
I didn't want to use it on a filthy human...

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:31.690
...but this is my favorite.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.360
I'm going to gouge out your life.

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:39.930
Is that right? Seems like a waste 
for such a beautiful knife.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:42.770
But that's how corrupt its master has gotten.

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:45.100
Should be anytime now...

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:53.280
Chiyo-san! That's enough! Here he comes!

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:21.300
What is that?!

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:35.820
This is perfect timing. I'll 
introduce you, Komatsu.

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:37.350
That's...

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:49.030
...my partner.

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:06.310
That's...

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:09.450
...my partner.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:26.100
That's...

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:28.230
...a GT Robot!

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:37.440
Who's the operator?!

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:40.410
I sense a tremendous presence...

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:46.050
There aren't even a few people 
in the world at this level!

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:51.390
Trying to keep up with the young is 
a good way to shorten your lifespan.

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:53.690
That'll do...

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:55.190
...old woman.

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:03.770
Our goal has already been achieved.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.040
We have no more business here.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.440
Let's return to the Gourmet World.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:14.780
T-Take-chan, your partner...

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:18.080
Komatsu... and Toriko...

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:19.950
Remember this.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:23.690
The one who will eat GOD is 
the boss of Gourmet Corp...

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:25.760
...Midora-sama.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.330
And the person who's going to cook it...

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:31.130
...is me, his partner.

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:41.670
Eventually, it'll become 
crystal clear to you, Komatsu.

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.880
Who's superior?

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.380
You or me? And also, you and partner

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.450
versus me and my partner.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.450
Take-chan...

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:03.190
Until then, polish your skills 
as much as you possibly can.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.900
Raise your rank as a chef.

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.760
Because if you don't,

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:11.600
it won't be worth beating you.

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:26.680
T-Take-chan...

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.920
I'm not going to lose...

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:38.260
I'm going to stick to my own way!

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:43.400
You sold your soul to Gourmet Corp, 
Take-chan, but no matter what you do,

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.800
I'm not going to lose! I swear it!

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:51.510
I swear I'm not going to lose!

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:09.560
I'm looking forward to it.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:14.330
The next time we meet, it'll be at the 
home of food itself, the Gourmet World.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:19.400
Let's meet at the festival.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.850
That was a Big Bang Shark.

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.490
A creature from the Gourmet World.

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:42.660
I can't believe a monster like 
that is obedient to him...

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.120
The boss of Gourmet Corp...

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:47.230
No. That wasn't the boss...

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:57.170
The boss is hungry.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:01.770
All play and no work is 
problematic for us, old woman.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.710
In your battle with the old man,

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:07.380
you suffered enough injuries.

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:09.820
Plus, with Toriko as he is now, 
you were out of your league.

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:12.680
There was nothing to worry about.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:14.820
And Otake...

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:18.260
...you and the boss are partners, you say?

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:20.560
It isn't good to lie.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.830
It'll become true soon enough.

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:25.560
Besides...

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:28.530
...Midora-sama said,

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:34.840
"All of the Gourmet Corp 
chefs are my partners."

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:40.180
Well, for now, you and I are partners.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.850
A new type of GTO Robot...

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:46.650
Its capabilities have improved dramatically.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:50.990
That man's raw power came 
through loud and clear.

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.360
He's...

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:54.930
...Starjun.

00:16:56.760 --> 00:17:01.830
It's a good thing you're a Vice-Chef 
as well as a Gourmet Hunter.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.940
Otherwise, I wouldn't 
have become your partner.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:12.610
So you're even trying to use me as a 
stepping stone. I like that ambition.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:13.940
Aside from that...

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:19.780
...you have Gourmet Luck, which I don't have.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:25.560
And that's necessary for obtaining God.

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:30.160
Now, let's hurry.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:33.730
It seems things are moving along 
quickly at last in the Gourmet World.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.790
Koma-chan!

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:04.230
Let's all become first-rate chefs!

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:22.980
Take-chan!!

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:31.890
He was my friend...

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:35.820
He was my colleague...

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:38.530
Komatsu...

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:47.800
Otake, the owner-chef of Fairytale Castle...

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:53.110
...has been given a direct 
injection of Gourmet Cells.

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.980
If he was your friend...

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:05.380
If he was your colleague...

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:07.890
...no matter what it takes,

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:10.790
let's make Otake realize he's made a mistake.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:13.760
With your cooking

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:15.360
and my strength,

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:17.900
we'll show him

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:19.530
that we're right!

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.170
Toriko-san...

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:25.200
We've got to beat him

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.570
<i>because</i> he's your comrade!

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:32.540
Because he's my comrade...

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:36.210
Let's all become first-rate chefs!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:47.020
Right! The two of us will beat him!

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:50.900
I'm sure you'll be alright.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:57.030
But there's no guarantee that I'll win.

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:03.410
Still...

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:06.410
Why did Take-chan become partners with <i>him</i>?

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:09.610
And why did Chiyo-san join Gourmet Corp?

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:15.920
I... I'll tell you why...

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:18.160
Master!

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:20.420
Please, don't speak!

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:21.890
Master Chin!

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:25.060
This isn't good! His temperature 
is dropping rapidly!

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:29.200
Hey, Master!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:14.710
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:22.550
The world is spinning

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:27.690
A dream flower

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.390
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:38.400
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:42.440
Lead me by the hand

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:45.810
And take me with you

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:53.080
Don't leave me here alone

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:56.820
Red shoes

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:00.650
I can't take off

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:11.960
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:16.870
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:21.340
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:26.380
Hiding Level
8

00:22:21.970 --> 00:22:24.240
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 8!

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:26.380
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds!

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:31.280
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:36.460
Alright, today we're at the central 
wholesale market, World Kitchen.

00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:38.760
Where could Yun be?

00:22:38.760 --> 00:22:41.130
Yun is... right here!

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:50.600
Did you find him?

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:53.300
Yun was working really hard, huh?

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:56.980
I have to work really hard 
too, so I can get a scoop!

00:22:57.710 --> 00:22:59.840
Although I feel like I'm 
always just saying that...

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:02.180
I'll do my best!

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:04.880
And now, our next segment!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.520
It's a heaping helping of all-stars!

00:23:08.520 --> 00:23:11.190
All the IGO's greatest agents are here!

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:12.800
The decisive battle is coming soon!

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:17.390
The Legendary Ingredient, "Center"! Ichiryu and the Strongest Biotope, 0!

00:23:17.760 --> 00:23:19.480
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
